# MVP Collaboration Model

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-mvp-collaboration-model.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-mvp-collaboration-model.md)

## Locked: B

Living Care Record = care recipient’s. Multiple contributors with attribution from day one.

Not MVP: family chat, social feed, household management.  
Never: separate realities per caregiver.

Vocabulary: Care Recipient · Contributor · Care Reality — not “users/workspace.”

Conflicts → keep both + uncertainty. One person · one LCR · many trusted contributors.
